``` LF-12 | Forwarder Throughput Throttling and Parsing Bottlenecks
    Interpretation and RCA: Splunk Administrator Field Manual (Gaurav Malik),
    entry LF-12. https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HRXCT384

    Run on: SH, with the forwarders' _internal forwarded.
    Query: CPU per pipeline processor on a heavy forwarder (SH)
    If this returns nothing, run probes/LF-12-probe.spl to confirm the data it
    reads exists here.
    Replace any <angle-bracket> placeholders before running.
```
index=_internal source=*metrics.log group=pipeline earliest=-4h host=<heavy_fwd>
| stats sum(cpu_seconds) as cpu_s sum(executes) as executes by name processor
| eventstats sum(cpu_s) as total_cpu_s
| eval pct_cpu=round(100 * cpu_s / total_cpu_s, 1),
       cpu_s=round(cpu_s, 1)
| sort - cpu_s
| head 15
